    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Attorney is a professional and modern WordPress theme designed for attorneys, law firms, legal consultants, lawyers, advocates, and other legal professionals. It provides a clean, trustworthy, and responsive design to help legal businesses establish a strong online presence and showcase their services effectively. The theme includes dedicated sections for legal services, attorney profiles, practice areas, testimonials, case studies, FAQs, blog posts, and contact information. Its professional layout makes it easy to present your expertise, experience, and legal services clearly to potential clients. ST Attorney is built with a responsive design that works smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It is suitable for individual lawyers, small legal practices, established law firms, legal advisors, and corporate legal departments. Whether you are an independent attorney or operate a growing law firm, ST Attorney provides the professional foundation you need to build a credible and effective legal website."
    },
